# ── P0 SECURITY: credential material must never be committed ──
# users.json is a Firebase Auth account export: email + scrypt passwordHash + salt
# + localId for every employee. It was tracked in commit 6b13678 and remains in git
# history. Untracking it stops further exposure; see the audit report for the
# mandatory history-purge and credential-rotation steps.
